RiYv default-size__BJ5Po default-accent__YcamO round-shape__sOoT2 clickable__llABU" href=https://www.wattpad.com/stories/klaushargreeves><span class=typography-label-small-semi>klaushargreeves</span></a><a class="no-text-decoration-on-focus no-text-decoration-on-hover o-ldm pill__pziVI default-variant__ERiYv default-size__BJ5Po default-accent__YcamO round-shape__sOoT2 clickable__llABU" href=https://www.wattpad.com/stories/luther><span class=typography-label-small-semi>luther</span></a><a class="no-text-decoration-on-focus no-text-decoration-on-hover o-ldm pill__pziVI default-variant__ERiYv default-size__BJ5Po default-accent__YcamO round-shape__sOoT2 clickable__llABU" href=https://www.wattpad.com/stories/lutherhargreeves><span class=typography-label-small-semi>lutherhargreeves</span></a><a class="no-text-decoration-on-focus no-text-decoration-on-hover o-ldm pill__pziVI default-variant__ERiYv default-size__BJ5Po default-accent__YcamO round-shape__sOoT2 clickable__llABU" href=https://www.wattpad.com/stories/theumbrellaacademy><span class=typography-label-small-semi>theumbrellaacademy</span></a><a class="no-text-decoration-on-focus no-text-decoration-on-hover o-ldm pill__pziVI default-variant__ERiYv default-size__BJ5Po default-accent__YcamO round-shape__sOoT2 clickable__llABU" href=https://www.wattpad.com/stories/theumbrellaacademyxreader><span class=typography-label-small-semi>theumbrellaacademyxreader</span></a><a class="no-text-decoration-on-focus no-text-decoration-on-hover o-ldm pill__pziVI default-variant__ERiYv default-size__BJ5Po default-accent__YcamO round-shape__sOoT2 clickable__llABU" href=https://www.wattpad.com/stories/tuaxreader><span class=typography-label-small-semi>tuaxreader</span></a><a class="no-text-decoration-on-focus no-text-decoration-on-hover o-ldm pill__pziVI default-variant__ERiYv default-size__BJ5Po default-accent__YcamO round-shape__sOoT2 clickable__llABU" href=https://www.wattpad.com/stories/viktor><span class=typography-label-small-semi>viktor</span></a><a class="no-text-decoration-on-focus no-text-decoration-on-hover o-ldm pill__pziVI default-variant__ERiYv default-size__BJ5Po default-accent__YcamO round-shape__sOoT2 clickable__llABU" href=https://www.wattpad.com/stories/viktorhargreeves><span class=typography-label-small-semi>viktorhargreeves</span></a></div></div><div class=_6g2c3><pre class="qzqzr x-339">Six years have passed since everyone was brought to the &#x27;new universe,&#x27; and Five and Y/n are still going on stronger, even stronger than before. As CIA agents, they&#x27;re currently investigating as suspicious group called &quot;The Keepers&quot;

A birthday party calls everyone together, but when Viktor doesn&#x27;t arrive, they all get a little suspicious and go out to search for him and end up meeting a man who is missing his daughter: Jennifer Grossman.

They&#x27;re sent on a mission to find the girl after mysteriously gaining their powers back, but are met with many unexpected events, including meeting the one man they wish they wouldn&#x27;t: Sir Reginald Hargreeves.

Do they end up finding the girl? Will Five and Y/n find out what it is The Keepers are up to? Will they even survive this new timeline? Read to find out in the final part of &#x27;The Space Between Us&#x27; series!<div class=V1nL2 data-testid=copyright><span class=dyK9G aria-hidden=true></span>All Rights Reserved</div></pre><div class=c-68l><button class=cQnUU>Read more</button></div></div><div class=kHUSJ><div class="AMIOO _6SD5M"><div class=_9c7jH data-testid=tag-carousel><a class="no-text-decoration-on-focus no-text-decoration-on-hover o-ldm pill__pziVI default-variant__ERiYv default-size__BJ5Po default-accent__YcamO round-shape__sOoT2 clickable__llABU" href=https://www.wattpad.com/stories/allison><span class=typography-label-small-semi>allison</span></a><a class="no-text-decoration-on-focus no-text-decoration-on-hover o-ldm pill__pziVI default-variant__ERiYv default-size__BJ5Po default-accent__YcamO round-shape__sOoT2 clickable__llABU" href=https://www.wattpad.com/stories/allisonhargreeves><span class=typography-label-small-semi>allisonhargreeves</span></a><a class="no-text-decoration-on-focus no-text-decoration-on-hover o-ldm pill__pziVI default-variant__ERiYv default-size__BJ5Po default-accent__YcamO round-shape__sOoT2 clickable__llABU" href=https://www.wattpad.com/stories/ben><span class=typography-label-small-semi>ben</span></a><a class="no-text-decoration-on-focus no-text-decoration-on-hover o-ldm pill__pziVI default-variant__ERiYv default-size__BJ5Po default-accent__YcamO round-shape__sOoT2 clickable__llABU" href=https://www.wattpad.com/stories/benhargreeves><span class=typography-label-small-semi>benhargreeves</span></a><a class="no-text-decoration-on-focus no-text-decoration-on-hover o-ldm pill__pziVI default-variant__ERiYv default-size__BJ5Po default-accent__YcamO round-shape__sOoT2 clickable__llABU" href=https://www.wattpad.com/stories/diego><span class=typography-label-small-semi>diego</span></a><a class="no-text-decoration-on-focus no-text-decoration