Every mission you have taken, you could complete but somehow he was the only mission you couldn't complete.
Why was that?
In which The Handler's niece, you, Y/n Smith who is the best female assassin is sent out on a special mission to stop your 'old friend' and coworker Five Hargreeves in saving the world.
But the more time you spend with him, the more you start caring for him and old feelings are waking up for the both of you.
So now is up to you to make a choice, risking your own life by going against your aunt's order or fight through those feelings, ignore them and complete your mission, stopping Five Hargreeves.
You have to make a sacrifice involving the ones you love and decide what or rather who is most important to you.
