IMPORTANT NOTE: READ THE FIRST TWO BOOKS BEFORE READING THIS.
Six years have passed since everyone was brought to the 'new universe,' and everyone lost their powers. Your and Five's marriage didn't hold and you have decided to take a break but you still remained friends.
As CIA agents, you and Five are currently investigating as suspicious group called "The Keepers"
A birthday party calls everyone together, but when Viktor doesn't arrive, you all get a little suspicious and go out to search for him and end up meeting a man who is missing his daughter: Jennifer Grossman.
You and the others is sent on a mission to find the girl after mysteriously gaining your powers back, but are met with many unexpected events, including meeting the one man they wish they wouldn't: Sir Reginald Hargreeves.
Do you end up finding the girl?
Will you and Five find out what it is The Keepers are up to?
Will this new mission bring you and Five closer?
Will you and Five decided to give your relationship another chance?
Will you even survive this new timeline?
Read to find out...
