BOOK 3 of 'Two assassins in love' 
IMPORTANT NOTE: READ THE FIRST TWO BOOKS BEFORE READING THIS.

"Never underestimate the simple, yet undeniable of true love"

The feeling remain, but the memory is unclear

It has being six years since the universe was reset and Five have spend those six years looking for you and the twins. 

After six years, he finds you but for some reason you don't know who he is, but Five refuse to let that stand in his way, and he is ready to do anything to get you and the twins back, but it don't get any easier for him when another guy is standing in his way, and not only that but you are in the claws of Reginald and he is not going to let you or the twins go that easy.

But Five will not let that take him out, he desperate in getting you his wife, the love of his life to remember him and get you back, whatever it takes. But how far will Five go to get what he wants, which can be dangerous?  

You're a famous singer and a single mother to six-year-old twins Jamie and Elliott. And is dating a sweet guy, your life is actually going great.  
But your life is change when suddenly a young guy show up in your life, claiming you that he is your husband and the father to your twins. 
He seems very familiar to you, but can you trust him after what your dad told you about him?

And it seems like somehow, Jamie and Elliott is the keys to something important.     

-Will you remember who this guy is?
-Why is the real reason why Reginald took you?
-What is so special about Jamie and Elliott that makes them so unique?
-Will Five be able to convince you who Reginald really is or can he make you remember him again?
-Is yours and Five love strong enough for you to be together again?
-How will Five and the twins react when they meet for the first time? 
-How much danger are your and the twins in? 

Read to find out.

Five Hargreeves x femreader!
Five Hargreeves x Y/n Watson
Season four
