WARNING SPOILERS for the Netflix Tv serie: The Umbrella Academy.`,cover:"https://img.wattpad.com/cover/337384420-256-k386111.jpg",completed:!0,tags:["abilities","aidangallagher","allisonhargreeves","diegohargreeves","fivehargreeves","fivehargreevesxfem","fivehargreevesxoc","fivehargreevesxreader","klaushargreeves","love","lutherhargreeves","netflix","reader","romance","texttospeech","theumbrellaacademy","vanyahargreeves"],mature:!0,url:"https://www.wattpad.com/story/337384420-my-savior-five-hargreeves-book-1",numParts:46,isPaywalled:!1,paidModel:""},{id:"348108041",title:"The Girl and The Boy (F. Hargreeves book 2) (Book 2)",user:{name:"Avengergirl99",avatar:"https://img.wattpad.com/useravatar/Avengergirl99.128.555708.jpg",fullname:"Harley Quinn123"},description:`IMPORTANT NOTE: READ THE FIRST BOOK BEFORE READING THIS.

You, your siblings, and boyfriend have gone through hell and back to save each other. One apocalypse in 2019, you all saved yourselves by time traveling, but you end up in the 1960's with a doomsday caused by a nuclear war. You again time traveled, but now are in a different timeline, with a new end of the world. 

After stopping the apocalypse, you, Five and the others of The Umbrella Academy managed to return home to the present, convinced they have prevented the initial apocalypse and fixed this godforsaken and terrible timeline once and for all. 

You and Five hopes that now the two of you can start your new life together. 
But when you return to the Academy, you all realize that things aren't exactly, when you left it. Your father is alive and you and your siblings have being replaced by a new group of superheroes name The Sparrow Academy and not only that but also your brother Ben is a member of the Sparrow, but he is not that Ben they used to know. 

The Sparrows directly encounters the same with the Umbrella gang in a violent confrontation. An unknown thing arrives and began to ravages the universe making animals and people to disappear without a trace and soon the whole universe is in danger.


Now they need to convince The Sparrow to help them save the universe but that's easier said than done.

You, Five and the rest of The Academy will be facing challenges to prove that nothing can stop a super dysfunctional family.

~Will you and Five finally have a chance to start a new life together or will things get in the way?
~Will you and your family be able to save the universe or will this new world reveal more than just a small timeline problem?

Read to find out

Five Hargreeves x fem!oc
Five Hargreeves x Reader

(Book 2)


